{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking in this strange school, my mind holds only puzzles and the one chasing me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run or hide? But what if death is the end either way...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood stains my hands before I notice\u2014did I do it again?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I try to piece truth from blurred faces... but were they ever real?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A\u00a0horror\u00a0story\u00a0set\u00a0in\u00a0a\u00a0school:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u00a0might\u00a0have\u00a0lived\u00a0through\u00a0it\u00a0once\u2026\u00a0but\u00a0you\u00a0remember\u00a0nothing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who\u00a0are\u00a0you?\u00a0Is\u00a0it\u00a0because\u00a0you\u00a0never\u00a0asked\u00a0the\u00a0right\u00a0questions,\u00a0or\u00a0did\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >they\u00a0never\u00a0want\u00a0to\u00a0answer?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And\u00a0what\u00a0if\u00a0the\u00a0ones\u00a0you\u2019re\u00a0trying\u00a0to\u00a0communicate\u00a0with\u00a0aren\u2019t\u00a0even\u00a0human? Some\u00a0clever\u00a0students\u00a0saw\u00a0through\u00a0the\u00a0school\u2019s\u00a0hidden\u00a0rules,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only\u00a0to\u00a0find\u00a0death\u00a0waiting\u00a0for\u00a0them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u00a0could\u00a0try\u00a0running\u00a0straight\u00a0for\u00a0the\u00a0exit\u00a0\u2014\u00a0but\u00a0what\u00a0if\u00a0you\u00a0can\u2019t\u00a0find\u00a0the\u00a0way\u00a0out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Relentless\u00a0pursuit:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore\u00a0in\u00a0the\u00a0dark,\u00a0but\u00a0beware:\u00a0something\u00a0far\u00a0worse\u00a0than\u00a0ghosts\u00a0is\u00a0hunting\u00a0you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your\u00a0past\u00a0tricks\u00a0for\u00a0escaping\u00a0won\u2019t\u00a0work\u00a0here,\u00a0so\u00a0watch\u00a0every\u00a0step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Numerous\u00a0puzzles:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The\u00a0puzzles\u00a0grow\u00a0more\u00a0complex\u00a0as\u00a0the\u00a0game\u00a0progresses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At\u00a0first,\u00a0you\u00a0might\u00a0guess\u00a0the\u00a0answers\u00a0\u2014\u00a0but\u00a0you\u00a0won\u2019t\u00a0be\u00a0able\u00a0to\u00a0guess\u00a0forever.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then\u00a0you\u2019ll\u00a0realize\u00a0you\u00a0should\u00a0have\u00a0paid\u00a0more\u00a0attention\u00a0to\u00a0the\u00a0clues\u00a0you\u00a0found\u00a0earlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>No\u00a0cheating\u00a0allowed:</strong>\u00a0Some\u00a0puzzle\u00a0solutions\u00a0are\u00a0randomized,\u00a0making\u00a0guides\u00a0useless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Pure\u00a0intensity:</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar\u00a0places\u00a0become\u00a0twisted\u00a0and\u00a0dangerous.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In\u00a0these\u00a0hallways\u00a0and\u00a0classrooms,\u00a0you\u2019ll\u00a0be\u00a0switching\u00a0between\u00a0running,\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solving\u00a0puzzles,\u00a0and\u00a0fighting\u00a0\u2014\u00a0the\u00a0only\u00a0chance\u00a0to\u00a0catch\u00a0your\u00a0breath\u00a0might\u00a0come\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from\u00a0meeting\u00a0your\u00a0classmates\u2026\u00a0or\u00a0maybe\u00a0not!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"P.E.: Athletic Ace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3360340/1fa8edd64fd2da5fc41625fa1d5cc1a9ea1d5a36.jpg"},{"name":"Math I: You Just Guessed, Right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3360340/12eea28f570144efc5e09058affdfb1bfe127d52.jpg"},{"name":"Literature: Answers Lie Within","pa